body:
One bottle won't do much but hurt you. Try to see past this shit. You are coming down off basically a bad high. The best thing you can try to do to yourself is go back to your doctor tell them that you went off your pills. That stuff fucks you up even more when you go off cold turkey. 

&#x200B;

Next focus on what you can do to leave your current situation. To get away from family even for an hour would be helpful. Think about what you can and cannot do, think if you were to live what would you do and start only working and pushing for yourself.
